f 17592186299706 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299707 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299708 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299709 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1041 "selection" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1104 #edb/ref 17592186299709 13194139534627 true] [17592186299704 1110 #uuid "39e36167-84f9-5e67-be00-821f7eaf5a43" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299705 1034 "-\\frac{1}{31}" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299705 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299705 1111 #uuid "5dc6ed21-4d14-5487-9e2a-cd7137502302" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299706 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299706 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299706 1111 #uuid "8ddbe6ee-3579-5f79-a8dc-bf9830a4b795" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299707 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299707 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299707 1111 #uuid "88c5ad39-d8bb-5051-ad7c-cc706e6cfd20" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299708 1034 "\\frac{1}{31}" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299708 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299708 1111 #uuid "6ac1308a-ed19-5aac-ab91-83edf5215d3d" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299709 1034 "0" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299709 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299709 1111 #uuid "c70deaec-200f-50f2-b249-669d65f73ade" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1017 #edb/ref 17592186299711 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1089 "q-73319" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1100 "Given that ${\\int }_{5}^{1}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-2$, calculate\n${\\int }_{1}^{5}(f(x)+4x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1113 #uuid "045da1f5-585f-50b0-a924-5246fd98534c" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299710 1145 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{5}^{1}\\,f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we can split up the given integral using the sum rule and factoring out the constants. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}(f(x)+4x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x+4{\\int }_{1}^{5}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2+4\\cdot {\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\,|}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =2+2({5}^{2}-{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =2+48 \\\\  & =50.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299712 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299713 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299714 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299715 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1000 #edb/ref 17592186299716 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1041 "selection" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1104 #edb/ref 17592186299712 13194139534627 true] [17592186299711 1110 #uuid "1d454a38-9ba8-58f8-b68e-2af8dc76037b" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299712 1034 "50" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299712 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299712 1111 #uuid "8da95193-8058-5c27-8283-3b59408ff8b4" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299713 1034 "-46" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299713 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299713 1111 #uuid "fe147f2b-dd6c-50a2-8624-dcc10267850e" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299714 1034 "-23" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299714 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299714 1111 #uuid "4f594b83-07c0-5c45-926e-4094083fdce0" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299715 1034 "-25" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299715 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534627 true] [17592186299715 1111 #uuid "d66cd3d1-e484-558e-baa3-b97b1c04ee50" 13194139534627 true] [17592186299716 1034 "24" 1319413